From 47f1f0ea717ba3bab068b0a222f7a58be110e895 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:09:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): Continue for every operation; no close while git
 runs

Continue runs git's own continue and goes on to the next stop;
unsaved edits and editor steps ask first; Continue and Abort also sit
in the choice, deleted-side and empty-stop rows. Stop and landed move
to currentStop.ts (#1386).

Refs plan #89
